r = 464697979898969456 - 464697979898969430 = 26\n\n26 = Q. Third-to-last digit is Q. Matches!\n\nq3 = 15489932663298981\n\nq3 mod 30:\n15489932663298981 / 30 = 516331088776632.7\n30 × 516331088776632 = 15489932663298960\nr = 15489932663298981 - 15489932663298960 = 21\n\n21 = L. Fourth-to-last is L. Matches!\n\nq4 = 516331088776632\n\nq4 mod 30:\n516331088776632 / 30 = 17211036292554.4\n30 × 17211036292554 = 516331088776620\nr = 516331088776632 - 516331088776620 = 12\n\n12 = C. Fifth-to-last is C. Matches!\n\nq5 = 17211036292554\n\nq5 mod 30:\n17211036292554 / 30 = 573701209751.8\n30 × 573701209751 = 17211036292530\nr = 17211036292554 - 17211036292530 = 24\n\n24 = O. Sixth-to-last is O. Matches!\n\nq6 = 573701209751\n\nq6 mod 30:\n573701209751 / 30 = 19123373658.366...\n30 × 19123373658 = 573701209740\nr = 573701209751 - 573701209740 = 11\n\n11 = B. So d2 = 11 = B.\n\nq7 = 19123373658\n\nq7 mod 30:\n19123373658 / 30 = 637445788.6\n30 × 637445788 = 19123373640\nr = 19123373658 - 19123373640 = 18\n\n18 = I. So d1 = 18 = I.\n\nLet me continue to verify the rest matches.\n\nq8 = 637445788\n\nq8 mod 30:\n637445788 / 30 = 21248192.933...\n30 × 21248192 = 637445760\nr = 637445788 - 637445760 = 28\n\n28 = S. Matches!\n\nq9 = 21248192\n\nq9 mod 30:\n21248192 / 30 = 708273.066...\n30 × 708273 = 21248190\nr = 21248192 - 21248190 = 2\n\n2. Matches!\n\nq10 = 708273\n\nq10 mod 30:\n708273 / 30 = 23609.1\n30 × 23609 = 708270\nr = 708273 - 708270 = 3\n\n3. Matches!\n\nq11 = 23609\n\nq11 mod 30:\n23609 / 30 = 786.966...\n30 × 786 = 23580\nr = 23609 - 23580 = 29\n\n29 = T. Matches!\n\nq12 = 786\n\nq12 mod 30:\n786 / 30 = 26.2\n30 × 26 = 780\nr = 786 - 780 = 6\n\n6. Matches!\n\nq13 = 26\n\nq13 mod 30:\n26 = Q. Matches!\n\nq14 = 0. Done.\n\nSo reading from most significant to least significant:\nQ, 6, T, 3, 2, S, I, B, O, C, L, Q, J, 6\n\nSo d1 = I = 18, d2 = B = 11.\n\n30 × d1 + d2 = 30 × 18 + 11 = 540 + 11 = 551.\n\nThe answer is 551.", "tool_calls": [], "created_at": 1786667953}
